  "text": {
    "paragraphs": [
      "Tom is in his bedroom. It is not clean. Mom looks at the floor. \"Where is your plane, Tom?\" \"It is under the bed,\" says Tom. \"What color is it?\" asks Mom. \"It is white and blue.\" Tom gets the plane. He puts it in a big box. The box is green.",
      "\"Where is your motorbike?\" asks Mom. \"It is behind the door,\" says Tom. The motorbike is red and black. Tom puts it in the box, too. \"Where are your books?\" asks Mom. \"They are on the bed,\" says Tom. \"Put them in the bookcase.\" The bookcase is brown. Tom puts the books on it. Mom smiles.",
      "Now the bedroom is clean. \"Where is Pip?\" asks Tom. Mom looks at the bed. Pip is not on the bed. Tom looks at the box. Pip is in the green box! He sleeps with the plane. \"Good night, Pip,\" says Tom. Mom says, \"Good night, Tom.\""
    ],
    "summary": "Mom asks Tom where his toys are and what color they are. Tom cleans his bedroom, and Pip sleeps in the green box.",
